&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Backtest</title><link>https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/benchmarks/benchmarks-backtest/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/benchmarks/benchmarks-backtest/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;backtest&lt;/code&gt; command replays historical CI runs against &lt;strong&gt;today&amp;rsquo;s&lt;/strong&gt; impact map and reports how often select mode would still have run failing jobs (recall) and how much job time it would have skipped (savings).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="method"&gt;Method&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="method"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#method" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For each record in a history file, the planner runs in &lt;strong&gt;select mode&lt;/strong&gt; with the recorded &lt;code&gt;base&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;commit&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;branch&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;changed&lt;/code&gt; paths. That reuses &lt;code&gt;internal/planner&lt;/code&gt; exactly as &lt;code&gt;plan --mode select&lt;/code&gt; does; backtest does not duplicate selection logic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For each job that ran in CI:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Outcome&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Meaning&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caught&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The job failed and select mode would still run it.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miss&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The job failed and select mode would skip it.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flaky&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The job failed then passed on a rerun of the same commit; excluded from recall.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recall&lt;/strong&gt; is &lt;code&gt;caught / (caught + misses)&lt;/code&gt; over non-flaky failures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Savings&lt;/strong&gt; sums &lt;code&gt;duration_s&lt;/code&gt; over jobs that ran historically but would be skipped, divided by total recorded job time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="history-file-format"&gt;History file format&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="history-file-format"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#history-file-format" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A JSON array of commits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;commit&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;sha&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;base&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;merge-base sha&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;branch&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;feature/x&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;changed&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;path&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;pkg/foo.go&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;status&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;M&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;jobs&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;go-test&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;status&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;failed&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;duration_s&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;120.5&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
